00697C  1                 ; https://forth-standard.org/standard/search/SEARCH_WORDLIST
00697C  1                 ; Find the definition named in the string.
00697C  1                 ; If the definition is not found, return zero.
00697C  1                 ; If the definition is found, return its execution token xt.
00697C  1                 ; If the definition is immediate, also return one (1), otherwise also return minus-one (-1).
00697C  1               Search_WordList:
00697C  1               @HdrPtr	= Temp0  ; ptr to current word Header (-@Off)
